  <div class="article-wrap">
    <h2 class="article-h3">Winserv as a company and a team</h2>
    <blockquote class="article-quote">"I do not seek to know the answers, I seek to understand the questions." — attributed to Confucius (our translation)</blockquote>

    <div class="article-body">
      <p>With the pace of technology in today's society, we understand how hard it is for anyone to keep up with — or even hear about — every new opportunity that comes from the global efforts of large companies to improve our lives and businesses. That is why, here at Winserv, we are ready to follow, explain and simplify every question brought to us.</p>

      <p>Unfortunately we do not have the answers to every problem yet, but we are sure that our dedication can solve most of them. <em>No one can be perfect, but that does not stop us from working hard and trying!</em></p>

      <p>We believe that <b>Technology</b> is more than a set of tools, solutions and ideas to be sold; in our view, it is deeply tied to our human nature <b>as a way of observing and improving the world around us.</b> Every great advance of our society can be traced back to this peculiar way we have of interpreting the world.</p>

      <p>With this in mind, we always favour <b>the individual side</b> of our personal and business relationships. We are people like you, ready to take on challenges whatever their size, always holding respect, friendliness and fraternity as ideals. At the end of the day, <b>we are all human, with our strengths and flaws.</b></p>
    </div>

